<title>GREECE: AVG PRICE AT GREEK AUCTION OF 7YR FRNS IS 101.04.</title>
<headline>AVG PRICE AT GREEK AUCTION OF 7YR FRNS IS 101.04.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following information on the Greek auction of seven-year floaters and three-year coupon bonds was made available by the Bank of Greece.</p>
<p>			   7-YEAR FRNS FORMULA:</p>
<p>1-YR T-BILL+1.30% 1-YR T-BILL:		   11.10% FACE VALUE:</p>
<p>1.0MLN DRACHMAS MIN PRICE ACCEPTED	    1,009,000 AVER PRICE</p>
<p>ACCEPTED	   1,010,486 MAX PRICE ACCEPTED	    1,016,200</p>
<p>AMOUNT COMPETITIVE	   250 BLN DRACHMAS AMOUNT</p>
<p>NON-COMPETITIVE	75 BLN DRACHMAS</p>
<p>			   3-YEAR COUPON BONDS COUPON:</p>
<p>10.20% FACE VALUE:		     1.0 MLN DRACHMAS MIN PRICE</p>
<p>ACCEPTED	    997,000 AVER PRICE ACCEPTED	   999,133.96</p>
<p>MAX PRICE ACCEPTED	   1,001,650 AMOUNT COMPETITIVE</p>
<p>120 BLN DRACHMAS AMOUNT NON-COMPETITIVE	36 BLN DRACHMAS</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
